---
import products from "../data/products.json";
---
<section class="configure section" id="elige"><div class="configure-copy"><p class="eyebrow">HAZLA TUYA</p><h2>Elige tu<br/><em>playera.</em></h2><p>Elige diseño y talla para ver el precio.</p><span aria-hidden="true" class="big-star">✦</span></div><div class="config-panel"><form id="config-form"><div class="form-heading"><h3>Elige la tuya</h3><span>100% ALGODÓN</span></div><label for="design">DISEÑO</label><select id="design" name="design">{products.map(p=><option value={p.key}>{p.name} · {p.author}</option>)}</select><fieldset><legend>TALLA</legend><div class="size-options"><label><input checked="" name="size" type="radio" value="CH"/><span>CH</span></label><label><input name="size" type="radio" value="M"/><span>M</span></label><label><input name="size" type="radio" value="G"/><span>G</span></label><label><input name="size" type="radio" value="XL"/><span>XL</span></label><label><input name="size" type="radio" value="2XL"/><span>2XL</span></label><label><input name="size" type="radio" value="3XL"/><span>3XL</span></label></div></fieldset><p aria-live="polite" class="finish-description" id="finish-description">Solo DTF: CH y M $380 · G $400 · XL $420 · 2XL $440 · 3XL $450.</p><p class="embroidery-hint" id="embroidery-hint">Acabado incluido: solo DTF.</p><div class="quantity-guide"><label class="quantity-field" for="order-quantity">CANTIDAD<input id="order-quantity" name="quantity" type="number" min="1" max="20" step="1" value="1" required/></label><button type="button" class="size-guide-button" data-open-size-guide>Guía de tallas ↗</button></div><div class="total"><span>Precio por playera <small>Pesos mexicanos</small></span><output aria-live="polite" id="total">$380 <small>MXN</small></output></div><button class="button dark add-order-button" type="button" data-add-order data-order-form="#config-form">Agregar al carrito ↗</button><button class="button dark copy-button" id="copy" type="button">Copiar mi selección <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><p class="selection-hint">Pégala en un mensaje para consultar disponibilidad.</p><p class="copy-status" id="copy-status" role="status"></p><textarea aria-label="Selección para copiar manualmente" hidden="" id="copy-fallback" readonly=""></textarea></form></div></section>